---
title: "C11 — Safe configuration mutation · Implemented"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Admin client
  participant A as Config service
  participant D as Database transaction
  C->>A: Change with expected config version
  A->>D: Lock workspace and recheck authority/version
  D->>D: Stage proposed definition change
  D->>D: Enumerate affected descendant paths
  D->>D: Resolve resulting statuses and fields
  D->>D: Validate affected live tasks and references
  alt Invalid or in-use configuration
    D-->>A: Roll back
    A-->>C: Typed conflict or domain error
  else Valid resulting configuration
    D->>D: Commit config version and outbox event
    A-->>C: Authoritative response
  end
